# M-package-manager step 6, panel 235's falsifier (R12, W4 as restated
# 2026-11-07): deleting the catalogue, deleting one of its entries, or
# mistyping a field of one never changes which module compiles, only whether
# the program builds, and a fetched copy left behind compiles nothing.
#
# The placed tree edited after it was placed: its fingerprint no longer
# the entry's `sum` (R7), so it compiles nothing.
use <json>/parse  #~ package_unread

function main()
    print(parse.value())
